  "protocol": {
    "prompt": "You are summarising a technical document for an engineer. Explain, in plain prose and without lists, why moving a small language model from a data centre to a personal computer changes the energy arithmetic of a single query. Cover the cooling water, the idle overhead of shared infrastructure, and the fact that the personal computer was already powered on for other reasons. Be concrete and avoid slogans.",
